    "description": "This was a SQL report project that involved me writing a SQL query that searched all the excessive claim amounts that were found in our database. Our claims department needed to see all the claims that were over $100,000 for each month within the last year. I created the query, and then transferred that to a stored procedure so we could use it in our report. Once I created the report using that stored procedure, I put the report up on our local website so the claims department could review it whenever they wanted.",
